{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集上演二女爭一男經典場面！何沛珈（Roxanne）與俞可程（Kanis）因同時對Oscar有好感，被製作組安排三人同車，氣氛極度爆笑尷尬。Roxanne更單刀直入質問情敵，究竟這場「三人行」最終如何收科？</p><p>二女一男同車上演經典黃金畫面</p><p>節目組為搞新意思，安排有好感的女神與求愛勇者同車前往拍攝現場，結果Roxanne及Kanis因之前都揀了Oscar，意外促成「三人同車」的經典黃金畫面。上車順序為Kanis、Roxanne及Oscar，當Kanis見到情敵Roxanne上車時，即時難掩尷尬大呼：「好尷尬呀，即係我哋要兩個女仔，加一個男仔同一架車。」沒想到Roxanne竟大方地主動出擊，直接向Kanis了解她與Oscar的發展進程，單刀直入問道：「我想同你傾吓偈，想知你到底係咪非佢（Oscar）不可，或者愛佢愛到揀唔到第二個喇？」對此，Kanis也坦白承認仍在觀察階段：「都要再多啲時間相處吓，有冇興趣了解多啲就一定有，但係咪非佢不可，放棄晒所有人，又未去到呢個程度。」</p><p>Oscar嚇到呆坐中間爆金句搞氣氛</p><p>最後登車的Oscar，一打開車門見到Roxanne和Kanis已在車廂中，亦嚇了一大跳，場面極度尷尬。不過他還是勇敢地提出「公道坐法」：「我坐中間咯」，更忍不住驚呼：「嘩！搞啲咁嘅嘢」、「開心驚喜刺激！」由於不知如何打開話題，三人一度陷入Dead air，尷尬的氣氛讓三人最終忍不住爆笑收場。為了化解僵局，Oscar更乘機搞氣氛大叫：「好喲，鬥尷尬咯！」這個舉動稍微緩和了現場的緊張氣氛，為之後的互動埋下伏筆。</p><p>Roxanne火力全開呷醋鬥嘴感情升溫</p><p>為打破悶局，三人將話題轉到「染髮」上，豈料竟演變成一場「差別待遇」的爭風呷醋事件。Roxanne突然「火力全開」，搞笑地向Oscar連環發炮求關注兼捉錯處：「點解你唔讚我嘅？」、「點解你留意佢 IG 嘅」。這場突如其來的鬥嘴，反而讓Oscar與Roxanne的感情意外升溫，Oscar事後表示：「當我了解多咗 Roxanne 之後，我會發覺原來佢好高冷，但係佢講嘢係好笑架喎，因為我自己又係好鍾意開玩笑，大家打乒乓波咁來回接笑點，係有畀 Roxanne 驚訝到嘅。」</p><p>情敵Kanis大方認輸：佢哋都幾夾</p><p>在Roxanne與Oscar一輪唇槍舌劍的鬥嘴期間，坐在旁邊的Kanis全程只能陪笑，默默觀察著兩人的互動。對於Roxanne與Oscar之間突然產生的化學作用，Kanis亦大方地表達了自己的看法，似乎已默默退出這場三角關係，她直言Oscar與Roxanne的互動很有趣，更承認兩人相當合襯：「我覺得佢哋嘅互動都幾搞笑，都幾啱傾嘅，我就覺得可能佢哋都幾夾。」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_13836228666ad1d2ad0c067.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_17267117066ad1d2b0c122f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_9827285726ad1d2b401041.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_6324061856ad1d2b6e4f0b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_2340442016ad1d2ba7c00f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_3241590596ad1d2bdb1b70.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_414894116ad1d2c1ba755.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_2129631546ad1d2c5924a9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_5738796016ad1d2c8abfc5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_10819031396ad1d2cb9f7ba.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_21443242406ad1d2cec0d47.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_8795757896ad1d2d200f5d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_20142671366ad1d2d4e6eeb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_13875182046ad1d2d810cd1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_5252866496ad1d2db35399.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_12584913256ad1d2de6a3b5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_5995484126ad1d2e21479f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_12922367466ad1d2e5720f0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_11942392436ad1d31046f71.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_6191424056ad1d313358ba.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_7148237976ad1d3165be4f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_20501058656ad1d31a553cf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T21:58:36.549192+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1385,"images":22,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T23:17:49.130016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T21:57:41.178996+00:00","content_hash":"693346e74810bd18e52559f80df2b927451cf265afe8286be878c1d396e0e7c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}